    kind: invariant  # 490e
    title: "rust: an instance-method call on a receiver whose type the signature DECLARES (sock: &UdpSocket) emits no call edge, while the generic-parameter form does -- the catalogued net_send row is unreachable"  # 490e
    status: violated  # 490e
    priority: 2  # 490e
    parent:  # 490e
    tags:  # 490e
